- * amount doesn't matter.
+ * ensure we can allocate the entire BO without hitting zero. The heap aligns
+ * heap addresses, not BO offsets, so the offset has to be a multiple of
+ * TU_DESCRIPTOR_SET_ALIGNMENT.
  */
